<title>UK: Wuestenrot Bank sets 500 mln mark eight-year FRN. [CORRECTED 11:03 GMT]</title>
<headline>Wuestenrot Bank sets 500 mln mark eight-year FRN. [CORRECTED 11:03 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects name of company in headline and table to Wuestenrot Bank from Wuestenrot Hypo)</p>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Bankgesellschaft Berlin and Norddeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUESTENROT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   SPREAD     +12.5 BP  MATURITY    29.OCT.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 6M LIBOR  PAY DATE    29.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.92     FULL FEES   0.20</p>
<p> LISTING    STUTTGART DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
